# apps/gatimitra-riderApp/.easignore
# EAS archives from the monorepo GIT ROOT, so every path here is git-root-relative.
# Goal: upload ONLY what the rider build needs (apps/gatimitra-riderApp + shared packages/),
# not the whole monorepo. Root-level dirs are ANCHORED with a leading "/" so a bare name never
# strips an identically named subdir INSIDE the rider app (e.g. its own src/, scripts/).

# --- Other apps / web projects (not needed for the rider build) ---
/apps/customer_app/
/apps/merchant_app/
/rider-web/
/cxsite/

# --- Backend / dashboards / web / infra (never needed for a mobile build) ---
/backend/
/dashboard/
/dashboards/
/partnersite/
/services/
/infra/
/docs/
/scripts/
/merchant_db/
/.github/

# --- node_modules anywhere (EAS installs deps on the builder) ---
**/node_modules/

# --- Native dirs: managed workflow; EAS runs expo prebuild (regenerates icons + native config) ---
/apps/gatimitra-riderApp/android/
/apps/gatimitra-riderApp/ios/

# --- Caches / build artifacts ---
**/.expo/
**/.expo-shared/
**/.gradle/
**/.next/
**/.cache/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/out/
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/logs/
*.log
*.tgz
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.keystore

# --- Env files (secrets) — keep examples ---
.env*
!env.example
!**/.env.example

# --- Editor / OS / tests ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/__tests__/
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
